{"288670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Myths Of Orion: Books of Power", "steam_appid": 288670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288670/extras/fbc83f56c44847506c9615398a68c8ef.avif?t=1763980280\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search detailed scenes, collect magical items, solve clever puzzles and unravel the Realm’s mysteries as Meredith, the brave enchantress’s daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day the mighty enchantress Salina gathered all of her strength and courage and stole the Books from the Wizard. Under the cover of a night, she took the Books and her child, baby Meredith, and ran far, far away to the north - to the very edge of the world. <br>And so, the years and decades passed by... until one day... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288670/extras/e12df74d49c83c2c80d6e0a9962cb16b.avif?t=1763980280\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Hidden Object &amp; Puzzle Adventure – investigate  scenes and solve mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Dozens of locations &amp; mini-games – mystery lurks from every dark corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ Map &amp; Journal – always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Full voiceovers &amp; HD visuals – immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ 3 difficulty levels – from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📴 Play completely offline — anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 No data collection — your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to search scenes, collect clues, combine items from your inventory, and complete mini-games to progress the story. Use hints if you get stuck — but the reward is uncovering more of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and solve the mystery in your own way: adjustable challenge: Casual, Adventure, and Challenging difficulty modes. Win Achievements &amp; Collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Atmospheric adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping mystery: narrative-driven gameplay with a strong detective lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations: explore, seeks, search and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288670/extras/02555f5fbc5e626b0a361c2a8941025a.avif?t=1763980280\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > TRACK down the missing Books of Power and stop the evil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > EXPLORE over 70 stunning locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > INVESTIGATE kingdoms of Elves, Humans and Orcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > USE the magic flowing through your veins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SOLVE dozens of brain-teasing mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SEARCH for clues and FIND HIDDEN OBJECTS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MEET unforgettable characters on your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > READ the Diary as you DISCOVER new worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > EARN achievements and COLLECT special items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ENJOY beautiful HD graphics and full motion videos<